  "description": "<div>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"124\" data-start=\"96\"><strong data-end=\"122\" data-start=\"100\">Brand Introduction</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"356\" data-start=\"125\">Woods Candle Co. is a luxury, small-batch candle brand that blends craftsmanship with meaning. Inspired by my surname and legacy, each candle is hand-poured with intention, creating a connection between heritage and home.</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"387\" data-start=\"358\"><strong data-end=\"385\" data-start=\"362\">Product Description</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"639\" data-start=\"388\">Our candles are crafted with soy wax and infused with pure essential oils, offering a clean, long-lasting burn. Each scent is carefully curated to evoke a sense of warmth, calm, and sophistication, making them perfect for any space or occasion.</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"678\" data-start=\"641\"><strong data-end=\"676\" data-start=\"645\">Our Unique Selling Points (USP)</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1012\" data-start=\"679\">\r\n<li data-end=\"752\" data-start=\"679\"><strong data-end=\"713\" data-start=\"681\">Hand-poured in small batches</strong> for quality and attention to detail.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"836\" data-start=\"753\"><strong data-end=\"788\" data-start=\"755\">Clean-burning &amp; eco-conscious</strong> &ndash; free from toxins, parabens, and phthalates.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"922\" data-start=\"837\"><strong data-end=\"871\" data-start=\"839\">Premium essential oil blends</strong> &ndash; delivering an elegant, long-lasting fragrance.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1012\" data-start=\"923\"><strong data-end=\"964\" data-start=\"925\">A meaningful story behind the brand</strong>, making each candle more than just a product.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1037\" data-start=\"1014\"><strong data-end=\"1035\" data-start=\"1018\">Payment Terms</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1255\" data-start=\"1038\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1122\" data-start=\"1038\"><strong data-end=\"1065\" data-start=\"1040\">Earn a 13% commission</strong> on every sale made through your unique affiliate link.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1187\" data-start=\"1123\"><strong data-end=\"1158\" data-start=\"1125\">Payouts are processed monthly</strong> with no minimum threshold.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1255\" data-start=\"1188\"><strong data-end=\"1218\" data-start=\"1190\">High average order value</strong>, meaning higher earnings per sale!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1284\" data-start=\"1257\"><strong data-end=\"1282\" data-start=\"1261\">Other Information</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1553\" data-start=\"1285\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1362\" data-start=\"1285\"><strong data-end=\"1360\" data-start=\"1287\">Ideal for lifestyle, home decor, wellness, and luxury niche creators.</strong></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1442\" data-start=\"1363\"><strong data-end=\"1409\" data-start=\"1365\">Marketing support &amp; exclusive promotions</strong> to help you maximize earnings.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1553\" data-start=\"1443\"><strong data-end=\"1467\" data-start=\"1445\">A brand with heart</strong> &ndash; we are a small business with a loyal community, ensuring strong conversion rates.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-is-only-node=\"\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-end=\"1645\" data-start=\"1555\">Ready to share our candles and start earning? Apply now and be part of our journey! 🔥💛</p>\r\n</div>",
